        <mxCell id="flow-legend" value="Flow&#10;1. DNS routes to the active region&#10;2. DNS holds the passive region on standby&#10;3. Primary LB to AZ-1 app&#10;4. Primary LB to AZ-2 app&#10;5. AZ-1 app to AZ-1 writer DB&#10;6. AZ-1 app to AZ-1 cache&#10;7. In-region standby DB replication (AZ-1 to AZ-2)&#10;8. AZ-1 app writes AZ-1 object store&#10;9. Passive LB to AZ-1 app&#10;10. Cross-region DB replication (primary to passive)&#10;11. Cross-region object-store replication (CRR)&#10;12. Regional queue drives the worker (async)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2400" y="120" width="380" height="228" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;Solid line = primary flow&#10;Dashed line = asynchronous / event-driven flow&#10;Red = blocked / missing / disabled&#10;🆕 = new in version N&#10;🔄 = changed in version N&#10;Dashed outer boundary = stack Boundary (profile brand color)&#10;Dashed inner boundary = Network Boundary (profile brand color)&#10;Numbered markers (1..N) = ordered data flow steps; see Flow list" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
